      "writtenOn": "2020-02-13T09:34:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does not the logic to update rq-\u003euclamp_hold_value (in both exp and !exp cases) means that you always (and just) set:\n\n   rq-\u003euclamp_hold_value \u003d rq-\u003euclamp[UCLAMP_MIN].value?\n\nWondering if we cannot simplify the code by removing this additional (duplicated?) value?",
      "range": {
